as well as a college student.

00:06:00.300 --> 00:06:03.701
And I'm the lawyer that pretty
much keeps him out of trouble.

00:06:03.701 --> 00:06:04.767
-Yeah, yeah,
and you do a great job.

00:06:04.767 --> 00:06:06.033
I want to show everybody a clip.

00:06:06.033 --> 00:06:08.701
Here's in Method Man in
"Power Book II: Ghost."

00:06:08.701 --> 00:06:10.033
