00:06:32.834 --> 00:06:34.634
-[ Bleep ]

00:06:34.634 --> 00:06:36.434
I need more.

00:06:36.434 --> 00:06:38.067
-Mrs. Tejada, Monet.

00:06:38.067 --> 00:06:39.534
Mrs. Tejada works.

00:06:39.534 --> 00:06:42.534
-Okay, Mrs. Tejada.
