00:06:52.734 --> 00:06:54.934
-Yeah, come on, now.
-Whoo! Whoo!

00:06:54.934 --> 00:06:58.601
-Method Man,
"Power Book II: Ghost"

00:06:58.601 --> 00:07:01.634
